14:04.000 --> 14:07.000
Agus bha, fhios agad, a h-uile sgath fosgailte.

14:08.000 --> 14:11.000
So ghabh mi, hamburgers, fhuair mi trì hamburgers,

14:11.000 --> 14:13.000
