15:31.000 --> 15:33.000
I’ve done that plenty of times.”

15:33.000 --> 15:35.000
Taing do Dhia gun tuirt mi siud, chaidh mi sìos.

15:35.000 --> 15:37.000
Fhios agad dè bh’ ann an job a bh’ agam?

15:37.000 --> 15:39.000
 A’ cur boltaichean ri chèile nuair a bha iad briste,

15:39.000 --> 15:42.000
