An rud a thachair, a laochain, start na h-einnseans

19:17.000 --> 19:18.000
’s a h-uile sgath riamh.

19:18.000 --> 19:21.000
An ath rud, a laochain, cha robh cuimhn’ agam riamh,

19:21.000 --> 19:23.000
the [...], cha robh sgath ann,

19:23.000 --> 19:25.000
